        "The toolchain image builds from .hack/toolchain/Dockerfile; the first build downloads pinned tools."
      ],
      "checks": [
        "Exit status 0 means typecheck and the repository check script passed."
      ],
      "cleanup": [
        "The one-shot container exits; installed dependencies stay in the toolchain_dependencies volume.",
        "Build tool caches written under the checkout are ignored by Git."
      ],
      "provenance": {
